# Replay moves the read position past an entry without applying it.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestReplaySkipsApply
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: replay advances the read position without applying the entry
PERTURBS: Replay

--- FIND
    /\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![a] = @ \cup {rp[a] + 1}]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the entry is not applied.
    /\ cache' = cache
--- END
